p.src:
A compact way to mark the rejected map is: $\text{religion}_{\text{common}}
\Rightarrow
\text{belief}+\text{ritual}+\text{fear}+\text{image}+\text{authority}.$ This is not Krishnamurti’s definition. It is the structure he is refusing. The word has become tied to systems of consolation and belonging, and therefore to thought’s search for security.

