p.src:
The correction is deliberately simple: $\text{religion}_{\text{inquiry}}
\Rightarrow
\text{gathering of total energy}.$ Religion, in the sense used here, is not a system of belief about an object called God. It is the gathering of energy at all levels–physical, moral, and spiritual–so that there is attention.

