p.src:
From hurt, a series of reactions follows: $\text{hurt}
\Rightarrow
\text{violence}+\text{fear}+\text{withdrawal}+\text{search for safety}.$ The search for safety may even create an idea of God as one who will never hurt. Here the beginning of the lecture returns: religion made by fear is not religion; it is a projection of hurt.

